window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>The battle for the fate of the earth has begun...</b></p> <p>A Lightbringer has crept into our realm, slithering in before the deadline with brand-new sinister plans. Chloe must face her past and deepest fears, and survive a trek through the darkest depths of all the realms to get her true love back.</p> <p>And Dwayne... well, let's not spoil his story. Although the \"King of Chaos\" has a nice ring to it.</p> <p>Savage Daemons <i>is book four and the final chapter in the bestselling urban fantasy series The Waif in the Wilds by Lauretta Hignett.</i></p>"; 
